"Use '.' (Unicode 'FULL STOP' (U+002E)) rather than ',' to indicate a decimal "
"point. Avoid using these symbols as a readability separator."
msgstr ""
"小数点を示すには、','ではなく'.'（Unicode 'FULL STOP' (U+002E)）を使用してく"
